       Q: Is the fatigue limit of 0.4 a continuous real-time ceiling that must never be exceeded at any instant during the shift, or a permitted end-of-shift accumulated score — because a time-averaged interpretation expands the feasible region significantly (allowing mid-shift peaks above 0.4 if followed by recovery periods)?
