       Q: Is the 80 dB limit an instantaneous peak ceiling (no single sample may exceed it), a short-term LAeq averaged over 1-minute windows, or the full 8-hour shift LAeq? A peak constraint is approximately 6 dB stricter than an 8-hour LAeq in typical press-shop environments.
