    4. operator_fatigue_index constraint (≤ 0.4) — temporal scope
       Q: Does the 0.4 fatigue ceiling apply instantaneously (the index must never exceed 0.4 at any point during the shift) or as a shift-average (mean value over 8 hours ≤ 0.4)? An average interpretation permits excursions above 0.4 for extended periods early in the shift.
