    5. context.scope — variant mix and product portfolio
       Q: Which product variants or SKUs are scheduled for this shift and in what proportions? Resource intensity and quality-grade weighting can differ by ±30% across variants, making delivered_value per resource unit ambiguous without a defined mix.
       A: Assume the same variant mix and proportions as the most recent completed shift of the same type; if unavailable, assume a single homogeneous product at the facility's median quality grade.

